```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client AppContext
    participant Adm as Admin/Owner Portal
    participant Sim as Drone Simulator
    participant G as API Gateway
    participant U as User Service
    participant P as Product Service
    participant O as Order Service
    participant Pay as Payment Service
    participant Ext as Stripe/MoMo
    participant MQ as Message Broker
    participant D as Delivery Service
    participant Set as Settlement Engine
    participant E as Email Service

    Note over C,O: Đặt món & thanh toán

    C->>G: POST /auth/login
    G->>U: Xác thực + cấp token
    U-->>G: JWT + hồ sơ
    G-->>C: Session

    C->>G: GET /restaurants,/products
    G->>P: Lấy catalog/branch
    P-->>G: Menu + giá
    G-->>C: Hiển thị

    C->>G: POST /customer/orders (cart,address,method)
    G->>O: Forward + x-user-id
    O->>P: Quote giá cuối
    P-->>O: Totals
    O->>O: Lưu order status=pending
    O-->>G: OrderId
    G-->>C: Hiển thị pending
    O->>MQ: order.created

    alt Thanh toán COD
        O->>O: status=confirmed, payment_status=unpaid
        O->>MQ: order.confirmed
    else Thanh toán Online
        C->>G: POST /payments {orderId, method}
        G->>Pay: Khởi tạo thanh toán
        Pay->>Ext: Create PaymentIntent
        Ext-->>Pay: client_secret
        Pay-->>G: client_secret/checkout_url
        G-->>C: Render UI thanh toán
        Note over Ext,Pay: Customer hoàn tất → webhook
        Ext-->>Pay: intent.succeeded/failed
        alt Success
            Pay->>MQ: payment.succeeded {orderId}
        else Failed
            Pay->>MQ: payment.failed {orderId}
        end
        MQ-->>O: Payment events
        O->>O: Update order status/payment_status
        O->>MQ: order.updated
    end

    MQ-->>D: order.created/order.confirmed
    D->>P: Lấy branch/hub
    D->>O: Đọc shipping snapshot
    D->>D: hubSelector + routeBuilder + create delivery
    D->>MQ: delivery.status (preparing→delivering→completed)

    C->>G: GET /api/deliveries/orders/:id
    G->>D: Lấy trạng thái/bản đồ
    D-->>G: Delivery snapshot
    G-->>C: UI tracking real time

    Note over C,O,Pay: Khách hủy đơn

    C->>G: POST /customer/orders/:id/cancel
    G->>O: Validate + cancel request
    O->>O: status=cancelled
    O->>MQ: order.cancelled
    MQ-->>D: Huỷ giao hàng/thu hồi drone
    alt Đã thanh toán online
        O->>Pay: internal refund request
        Pay->>Ext: Refund PaymentIntent
        Ext-->>Pay: refund result
        Pay->>MQ: refund.completed/refund.failed
        MQ-->>O: cập nhật payment_status
    end

    Note over Adm,Pay: Admin/Owner tạo refund thủ công

    Adm->>G: POST /admin/payments/:id/refund {amount,reason}
    G->>Pay: Forward request (auth)
    Pay->>Ext: refund API
    Ext-->>Pay: refund succeeded
    Pay->>MQ: RefundCompleted event
    MQ-->>O: update order.payment_status=refunded
    Pay->>Set: recordRefund + settlement adjustment

    Note over Pay,Set: Settlement & Payout

    loop Cuối ngày
        Pay->>Set: Aggregate payments by restaurant/branch
        Set->>Set: Tính gross/net/refund/tax
        Set->>Adm: POST /owner/payouts (API Gateway)
        Adm-->>Set: Confirm banking info
        Set->>Ext: Init bank transfer (nếu có)
        Set->>MQ: payout.created/payout.completed
    end

    Note over Sim,D: Drone simulator & telemetry

    Sim->>D: GET /api/deliveries (đang delivering)
    D-->>Sim: Danh sách delivery + hubs
    loop mỗi chu kỳ
        Sim->>D: POST /drones/:id/telemetry {lat,lng,battery,status}
        D->>D: telemetryProcessor cập nhật vị trí
        D->>MQ: delivery.telemetry + delivery.status nếu đổi bước
        MQ-->>C: (qua socket layer) cập nhật realtime
    end

    Note over E: Email/SMS

    MQ-->>E: order.updated/payment/refund/payout events
    E-->>C: Email xác nhận, huỷ, hoàn tiền, payout
```
